-- among the 256 quadruples of fourth roots of unity, det D = 0 at exactly 28: the 4 constant ones, where D = 0 (Γ, up
-- to a common phase), and 24 where D has rank one, the orderings of (1, i, −1, −i) (the W points)
dirac-unit-census : (if eqb (fst (dn-census dn-classify)) 4 then eqb (snd (dn-census dn-classify)) 24 else false) ≡ true
dirac-unit-census = λ i → true
